5/6/7. Fixture laundering / causal verification — PASS on the three
   largest-delta recalibrations, checked empirically by reverting ONLY the
   appended 2026 registry record (in a cp -a copy) and re-running:
     - failure_bounds_test.go "inflation" wantThreshold 14.3→14.1: with the
       2026 record removed, the search reproduces 14.3 exactly (old value)
